{\b NativeBox candidate build}\par
\par
This package installs a candidate build of NativeBox Driverless. Covered Win32 file and registry calls use selected private stores. ManagedProxy supports selected blocking TCP/IPv4 calls; DNS is local. This compatibility mode is not intended for safely running malicious programs. It does not install an additional driver.\par
\par
NativeBox original application code is licensed under the MIT License. Copyright (c) 2026 yorenov / akegga. The full notice is installed in licenses/NativeBox-MIT.txt. Third-party components retain their original licenses.\par
\par
Third-party components (Qt 6.8.3 under LGPL-3.0, Microsoft Detours 4.0.1 under MIT, SQLite in the public domain, Microsoft Offline Registry Library and Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable under their Microsoft redistribution terms) are listed with their license texts and corresponding source in the licenses folder of the installation directory.\par
\par
Uninstalling NativeBox removes the program. Sandboxes and settings stored in your user profile are kept. Upgrade from a legacy installation requires a verified backup of the affected data. This candidate does not certify all applications, Windows versions or hardware.\par
